# Fondwave Slate (Light) — Fond Light's neutral grey surfaces, with Fondwave's
# indigo/berry/coral highlights standing in for Fond's Adwaita blue.
#
# Every background/alternate/neutral-foreground value here is copied verbatim
# from FondLight.colors — the grey stack (Window/View/Button/Header/
# Complementary/Tooltip) is untouched. Only the accent-carrying roles change:
# DecorationFocus/Hover, ForegroundActive/Link/Visited/Negative/Neutral/
# Positive, and the whole Colors:Selection block, all pulled from Fondwave.colors'
# light-background set (its Window/View/Button block, not Complementary/Tooltip
# — those were tuned for a dark indigo backdrop, see FondwaveSlateDark).

